Soar EdgeTX BW

This repository contains an adapted SD-card/model package for EdgeTX
black-and-white radios, with a focus on RadioMaster Pocket.

Original work and authorship:

- SoarOTX soaring Lua scripts were created by Jesper Frickmann.
- Several SD-card scripts and wizard/tool components originate from OpenTX or
  EdgeTX projects and retain their original copyright and license headers.
- Individual source file headers remain authoritative for copyright and license
  attribution.

Adjustments in this repository:

- RadioMaster Pocket model archive and Pocket-oriented model setup.
- EdgeTX BW radio/model adjustments for the included soaring models.
- 128x64 and 212x64 BW script packaging for the included SD-card tree.
- Removal of the graph screen/model references where the graph wrapper is not
  used.
- Local SD-card cleanup and packaging for this repository.

